| `adr.number_digits` | integer | `4` | a positive integer fitting both spaces' file-name byte limits after the encoded template prefix and minimum `-a.md` suffix | check_Y | Bounds the width before pattern compilation or shape allocation. check_Y measures each directory's nearest existing ancestor; unavailable or unknown limits use the common NAME_MAX of 255 bytes. Oversized widths give one key-naming FAILURE finding. | the directory locations: `adr.project_dir` and `adr.template_dir` | always |
